{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context\nWhile recovering hapuku change 2852, review-bot logs showed repeated `review-bot webhook: rejected (missing/invalid token)` 401s from the Gerrit compose-network address after the bot token rotation. Manual `/review/rerun` with the SSM token succeeded and the bot could vote, so `/health` stayed green while live Gerrit webhooks were auth-dead.\n\n## RCA plan\n1. Compare the token in SSM, the review-bot container environment, and the Gerrit project `refs/meta/config:webhooks.config` header without printing secret values.\n2. Correlate 401 timestamps with token rotation, service-user/webhooks.config updates, and Gerrit/review-bot restart times.\n3. Prove whether fresh `patchset-created`/`comment-added` webhooks after Gerrit reload carry `X-Rebar-Token`.\n4. Fix the class by making stale webhook-auth failures operator-visible while `/review/health` is otherwise 200, and document the rotation/reload/smoke-test step that prevents cached plugin config from surviving token rotation.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Identify the source of the 401 deliveries and whether they were stale cached plugin config, queued stale deliveries, or a live producer missing the header.\n- [ ] Prove current `patchset-created` and `comment-added` webhooks carry `X-Rebar-Token` after the correction.\n- [ ] Add an operator-visible health/observability signal for webhook auth rejection while `/review/health` remains 200.\n- [ ] Update the review-bot/token rotation runbook with the required reload/restart and webhook smoke check.\n- [ ] Verify with a RED regression test, targeted tests, and `make verify PYTEST_WORKERS=2` before Gerrit review.\n"}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788958301177377001,"uuid":"cd313aba-6c27-4959-b091-9630da6a09d5"}